This set of artificial poinsettia flowers provides a festive addition to any holiday display, featuring a glitter finish that catches the light beautifully. The multi-colour design includes vibrant red, gold and silver tones to create a rich visual impact for seasonal celebrations.

The clip-on mechanism allows for easy attachment to Christmas trees, wreaths or garlands without requiring additional tools or adhesives. This practical feature ensures secure placement on branches while preventing damage to delicate foliage during installation.

Each individual flower measures approximately 14 centimetres in size, providing a substantial presence when arranged together on larger displays. The consistent dimensions ensure uniformity across all twenty pieces, creating a balanced and harmonious look when decorating your tree or mantelpiece.

The combination of fabric petals and plastic stems offers a realistic texture that enhances the natural appeal of these artificial blooms. The glitter coating adds a sparkling effect that complements other lights and ornaments commonly used during winter celebrations. This material choice ensures the decorations remain lightweight yet sturdy enough for repeated use year after year.

Containing twenty pieces per pack, this product quantity allows for extensive decoration coverage across multiple areas of your home interior. The generous count enables you to create full, lush arrangements on large trees or distribute them evenly among several smaller displays.
